abstract: >-
  Code, extracted features and result tables for a leakage-aware benchmark and audit of the
  RheumaPain dataset (wrist-worn Empatica E4 biosignals, children with rheumatic disease).
  Under leave-one-subject-out evaluation no feature model or 1D-CNN improved on the
  exercise/rest context alone, while random window splits inflated performance through
  subject identification.
